	     "effects":["Requests a consent information update, which is necessary for gathering updated user consent.", "The getConsentStatus() API return value will be updated synchronously to hold the consent state from the previous app session, if one exists.", "getConsentStatus() may be updated again to the up-to-date status after 'ConsentInformation.OnConsentInfoUpdateSuccessListener' is called."],
